ng Every Vector by Default is a Problem</a></li><li><a href=#how-to-generate-multivectors-using-fastembed>How to Generate Multivectors Using FastEmbed</a></li><li><a href=#step-by-step-colbert--qdrant-setup>Step-by-Step: ColBERT + Qdrant Setup</a></li><li><a href=#1-encode-documents>1. Encode Documents</a><ul><li><a href=#2-create-a-qdrant-collection>2. Create a Qdrant collection</a></li><li><a href=#3-upload-documents-dense--multivector>3. Upload Documents (Dense + Multivector)</a></li><li><a href=#query-with-retrieval--reranking-in-one-call>Query with Retrieval + Reranking in One Call</a></li></ul></li><li><a href=#conclusion>Conclusion</a></li></ul></li></ul></nav><ul class=table-of-contents__external-links><li class=table-of-contents__link><a href=https://qdrant.tech/documentation/tutorials-search-engineering/using-multivector-representations/index.md target=_blank><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M1.5.0C1.22386.0 1 .223858 1 .5v15c0 .2761.22386.5.5.5h13c.2761.0.5-.2239.5-.5V5.5C15 5.36739 14.9473 5.24021 14.8536 5.14645L9.85355.146447C9.75979.0526784 9.63261.0 9.5.0h-8zM2 15V1H9.29289L14 5.70711V15H2zM4 5.5c0-.27614.22386-.5.5-.5h2c.27614.0.5.22386.5.5s-.22386.5-.5.5h-2C4.22386 6 4 5.77614 4 5.5zM4.5 8c-.27614.0-.5.22386-.5.5s.22386.5.5.5h7c.2761.0.5-.22386.5-.5s-.2239-.5-.5-.5h-7zm0 3c-.27614.0-.5.2239-.5.5s.22386.5.5.5h7c.2761.0.5-.2239.5-.5s-.2239-.5-.5-.5h-7z" fill="#DC244C"/><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M9.5.0c.27614.0.5.223858.5.5V5h4.5c.2761.0.5.22386.5.5s-.2239.5-.5.5h-5C9.22386 6 9 5.77614 9 5.5V.5c0-.276142.22386-.5.5-.5z" fill="#DC244C"/></svg>
View as Markdown</a></li><li class=table-of-contents__link><a href=https://github.com/qdrant/landing_page/tree/master/qdrant-landing/content/documentation/tutorials-search-engineering/using-multivector-representations.md target=_blank><svg width="16" height="17" viewBox="0 0 16 17" fill="none"><g clip-path="url(#clip0_6269_955)"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M8 .700012c-4.4.0-8 3.599998-8 7.999998C0 12.2333 2.26667 15.2333 5.46667 16.3 5.86667 16.3667 6 16.1 6 15.9S6 15.2333 6 14.5667C3.8 15.0333 3.33333 13.5 3.33333 13.5 3 12.5667 2.46667 12.3 2.46667 12.3 1.66667 11.8333 2.46667 11.8333 2.46667 11.8333 3.26667 11.9 3.66667 12.6333 3.66667 12.6333 4.4 13.8333 5.53333 13.5 6 13.3 6.06667 12.7667 6.26667 12.4333 6.53333 12.2333 4.73333 12.0333 2.86667 11.3667 2.86667 8.30001c0-.86666.33333-1.6.8-2.13333.0-.26667-.33334-1.06667.13333-2.13333.0.0.66667-.200000000000001 2.2.8.66667-.2 1.33333-.26667 2-.26667S9.33333 4.63335 10 4.83335c1.5333-1.06667 2.2-.8 2.2-.8C12.6667 5.16668 12.3333 5.96668 12.2667 6.16668 12.8 6.70001 13.0667 7.43335 13.0667 8.30001c0 3.06669-1.8667 3.73329-3.6667 3.93329C9.66667 12.5 9.93333 12.9667 9.93333 13.7c0 1.0667.0 1.9333.0 2.2C9.93333 16.1 10.0667 16.3667 10.4667 16.3c3.2-1.0667 5.4666-4.0667 5.4666-7.59999C16 4.30001 12.4.700012 8 .700012z" fill="#F0F3FA"/></g><defs><clipPath id="clip0_6269_955"><rect width="16" height="16" fill="#fff" transform="translate(0 0.5)"/></clipPath></defs></svg>
